# Henry chain and UI

- Wire every public and app route. Do not leave orphan page components.
- Sessions: httpOnly signed cookies with SESSION_SECRET. Scope all store access by tenantId.
- Chain: ClampAudit on Base Sepolia via viem. Fail clearly if RPC, key, or contract address is missing.
- Mandate create or revoke and decision receipts must persist server side and, when configured, write a real tx hash.
- Consume Song interfaces only from src/server/integrations/song/. Catch SongNotWiredError and show a clear UI error.
- Client RPC belongs in src/api/* via createServerFn. Never import src/server/** from client components.
- Prefer existing clamp components and TanStack Start patterns. Do not invent a second router.
